 "source": {
  "revision": "PD-96278B, 02/29/12",
  "pages": 11
 },
 "summary": "A single N-channel HEXFET power MOSFET in the three-lead Micro3 (SOT-23) package, aimed at load and system switching. It blocks 30 V, carries 5.3 A continuously at 25 °C ambient (21 A pulsed) and has its on-resistance specified at two gate drives: 27 mΩ max at VGS = 10 V and 40 mΩ max at 4.5 V. The gate is rated ±20 V. Lead-free, bromide-free and halogen-free, RoHS compliant, MSL1.",
